    "sweep-093761a6b3534759": {
      "id": "sweep-093761a6b3534759",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The lease carries workflow_id, lease_id, status, acquisition and heartbeat times, blockers, and an optional requested_handoff. A handoff uses target_kind and target_workflow_id plus the request lineage. Null active_workflow means authority is free, even when domain workflow records remain readable."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "sweep-c146598018a6470b": {
      "id": "sweep-c146598018a6470b",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Projection and Revisions"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "sweep-32c26226036d4707": {
      "id": "sweep-32c26226036d4707",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Operator Actions owns the dashboard action projection. Dispatch coordination and harness state each have independent revisions. Neither revision is a Git commit or a shared version copied onto all domain records."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "sweep-cfa31582c2694c00": {
      "id": "sweep-cfa31582c2694c00",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Accepted coordination changes record event provenance with the state transition. created_at and updated_at preserve record timing. caused_by_event_id may be null at initialization, so reconstruction must not invent an accepted event for that initial value."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "sweep-5f1bb24a8a194daf": {
      "id": "sweep-5f1bb24a8a194daf",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "HarnessState is defined in apps/server/src/core/harness-state/state.ts. DispatchState is defined in apps/server/src/core/harness-state/types.ts. Dashboard composition is implemented in apps/server/src/application/dashboard/read-model.ts."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
